  "description": "A high-performance, fully custom-drawn KumikoUI DataGrid control for .NET MAUI. Features virtual scrolling, sorting, filtering, grouping, cell editing, theming, row drag-and-drop, frozen columns/rows, and table/group summaries, drawn with SkiaSharp.",
